# tools/ — a ONE-TIME AMNESTY, not a precedent. See DECISIONS.md ADR-019.
#
# The /tools section (11 pages, validator, shared modules) landed on main in
# #56 while the toolbox was still on a branch, so it was written before this
# config existed. Measured: formatting it would rewrite 2763 lines across 7
# files — tools-data.js alone goes 1809-changed-of-1661, because it is compact
# content data that Prettier would explode. That diff would bury the next real
# content change and conflict with anything still in flight.
#
# Anything created AFTER the toolbox lands on main is formatted from birth and
# does not get added here.
tools/
